{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"前一段的安稳并没有被否定，却开始不再足以让人只是安然停留；温柔仍在，同时生出更明显的牵挂、期待和一点不能落定的不安。因为刚刚真正得到过满足，这里的悬着已经不同于开头单纯的迟疑：人现在更清楚自己舍不得失去什么。\",\"thread\":\"前面的满足之所以能让人安稳，是因为它真实承接了那件重要却尚未想清楚的事；但它并没有回答原先悬着的问题。等直接的满足不能再把注意力完全留住，那个未回答的部分便重新显出来，而此时人已经亲身知道这件事能给自己什么，于是原来的迟疑多了一层具体的牵挂：既还没有把握，又已经不能像从未得到过那样轻轻放下。\",\"used\":\"第1段已经确认这件事具有不能略过的分量，却尚无明确的回应；第2段已经实际经验到亲近、安稳和满足，同时也知道这份满足并不等于问题已经解决。\",\"new\":[\"真实的满足不仅能够暂时安顿未解决的问题，也会使人对这份满足产生更具体的牵挂；因此当安稳不能继续完整承接一切时，原有的悬而未定会比从前更切身。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2f144f68-b1c1-43c4-9b1a-54bc6c175aa8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T224201546856Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.781, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:42:37.341067+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "71e544265c3cc17167c764c2932b1c7032a1843ca3ac2e708bbc34fb149749ab", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at